    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "subsection (4) (notice to be given at or brought up and read at meeting of directors) does not apply"
    ELSE IF `the general notice is given at a meeting of the directors` OR `the director takes reasonable steps to secure that it is brought up and read at the next meeting of the directors after it is given`
         THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "General notice is not effective unless— (a) it is given at a meeting of the directors, or (b) the director takes reasonable steps to secure that it is brought up and read at the next meeting of the directors after it is given."
         ELSE JUST TRUE

