    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "General notice is not effective unless"
    ELSE IF `the answer under section 185(2)` EQUALS JUST TRUE AND `the answer under section 185(3)` EQUALS JUST TRUE AND `the answer under section 185(4)` EQUALS JUST FALSE
         THEN JUST TRUE
